Selected Idea
-------------

Introduce Nuëyon as an AI‑first company and position Nuëyon.Compose as its first concrete step
Present Nuëyon’s core identity and immediate focus: an AI‑first software company building reusable AI‑native products for other AI‑first businesses, with Nuëyon.Compose the initial, narrow implementation that makes the company’s principles tangible.

